 ↔ Dejan Lovren (2022 World Cup, 98%).","Nathan Aké ↔ Gen Shōji (2018 World Cup, 98%).","Andries Noppert ↔ Koen Casteels (Euro 2024, 97%)."],"impact":"A twin is not a clone: similarity compares per-90 profiles (shots, passes, xT, defending…), not talent. Still, it gives transfer ideas."}}}}